          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyeeyosia mumoni, narula; niyeesimilisia, nasunga ari Leere ebiliibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibamurenjeshela yenyene, nabo yabo bonyene, nabo abaMisiri aba yaliitsanga ninabo bonyene; okhuba abaMisiri shibafuchiilila okhulia ebiliibwa halala nende abaHeburania ta; okhuba kwalinji omusilo khubaMisiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibeekhala imbeliwe, omukhulundu khubukhulundu bubwe bwobwibule, naye omushe khubutuutu bubwe; abandu abo nibahumana abeene bonyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.43.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 43:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye nabamechela khubiliibwa okhurula khumeesaye; ne eshitonye shiaBenyamini shiashila eshiabandi bosi khubo khandi kharaano. Nibanywa, nibatsatsahala halala ninaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.43.34",
